  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-21T10:15:25.465Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When on a slow connection, it can take a while to download all the avatars in a crowded instance. If you change instances before this completes, these avatar downloads appear to remain in a download queue, and download in the background. This can result in avatars in the new instance you're in (perhaps even the avatar for the only player in the instance) being stuck at 0% until all prior downloads complete. This also appears to happen for worlds - world downloads will continue even if you hit the go home button while downloading.\nTo help avoid the appearance of stuck downloads (and the annoyance of seeing blue ghosts everywhere) VRChat should abort downloads for avatars and worlds if an instance change occurs while downloading.",
